        <activityName xml:lang="en">16.667kWp, 100m2, PV system for PVT, installed on slanted roof, single-Si</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 16.667kWp, 100m2, PV system for PVT, installed on slanted roof, single-Si
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 16.7kWp for a PVT system only and a life time of 30 years installed in CH.;
UUID: f343e106-7a73-3c54-b652-f574d1caea9b
All components for the installation of a 16.kWp photovoltaic plant, for a PVT-system (PV modules without flat glass!) energy use for the mounting, transport of materials and persons to the construction place. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in CH
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer and literature data on worldwide module production. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f343e106-7a73-3c54-b652-f574d1caea9b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
